{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aUIoE0VQ0C1795082668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯想集團經調整純利，按年大幅增長1.7倍。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底半年有24.3億美元。計及認股權證重估等虧損，就轉虧12.4億美元，去年同期賺逾8億美元。中期息增至每股9港仙。期內收入創新高，按年升四成半至571億美元。</p><p></p><p>單計第二季度，經調整純利增長1.6倍，至13.6億美元，不過整體由盈轉虧，蝕6.4億美元。收入則首次突破300億美元，創歷史新高，按年增長四成七。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.987626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.821519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.108648+00:00","content_hash":"f430f9bea337479c99106b979d1576ecd2a5793123ff760b22d4d65b77f69152","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.987626+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}